      "id": "claim_bbb0b7623d564bd0ae007f2c148b0ee7",
      "statement": "add_dependency is the only dependency-registration entry point: it refuses a name already present in dynamic_dep_registry with DependencyAlreadyRegistered (reporting it to Observability with layer \"framework\" and kind \"framework\" before raising) and otherwise stores the object in that dict.",
