      "id": "claim_056fa6f1cc184132bda6a2ab1168fd10",
      "statement": "The dependency registry and its locator are created per UseFramework instance in __init__ (dynamic_dep_registry plus _deps_locator over that dict), so two bounded contexts in one process never share dependencies.",
