    {
      "id": "claim_8b53e529f02140219496e9fbb4054207",
      "statement": "add_dependency's docstring records that calls must happen during startup before the first execution and not concurrently with in-flight requests, because dynamic_dep_registry is a plain dict with no lock (last write wins under the GIL, a genuine data race without it); the same docstring states the constraint is deliberately not enforced to avoid a breaking change.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L1320-L1323",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:68058e0a6a89fff5db847198a4356e5249210a2d7d9ddd6efd30d6adf2873863:"
