      "id": "claim_079197a43c374ac2ba1acfa1f1016ab6",
      "statement": "The add_dependency timing/safety caveat is restated at repository level: registries built once at startup (feature_registry, app_service_registry, dynamic_dep_registry, the middleware list) are safe only as long as nothing mutates them concurrently with in-flight executions — true today, not enforced — and the source marks these spots with PYTHON 3.14 FREE-THREADING comments.",
